2. File Storage Requirements

The frontend clearly supports candidate resume uploads and possibly document uploads for job-related applications.

2.1 Storage bucket requirements
Recommended Supabase Storage buckets:
- candidate-resumes
- company-documents
- job-attachments
- admin-exports (optional)

2.2 Candidate resume bucket config
Bucket: candidate-resumes
- public: false
- file size limit: 5 MB to 10 MB
- allowed MIME types:
  - application/pdf
  - application/msword
  - application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document
- allowed extensions:
  - .pdf
  - .doc
  - .docx
- optional image upload:
  - .jpg, .jpeg, .png for profile photo only if needed

Bucket policy idea:
- Users can upload only their own files
- Admins can read application documents
- Public read only on required files if using signed URLs

2.3 Employer document bucket
Bucket: company-documents
- file size limit: 10 MB
- allowed types:
  - pdf
  - doc/docx
  - jpeg/png

2.4 Job attachment bucket
Bucket: job-attachments
- optional job poster docs / certificates / onboarding docs

2.5 Recommended storage paths
- candidate-resumes/{year}/{month}/{application_id}/{filename}
- company-documents/{company_name}/{filename}
- job-attachments/{job_id}/{filename}

